<view class="container guide-page">
  <view class="guide-hero">
    <view class="hero-icon" aria-hidden="true">🎧</view>
    <view class="hero-title">开始听力测试</view>
    <view class="hero-description">
      通过左右耳纯音自测，初步了解不同频率下的听觉表现
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="notice-card">
    <view class="notice-title">测试结果仅供参考</view>
    <view class="notice-text">
      本测试不能替代专业医学检查。如有耳痛、持续耳鸣或明显听力下降，请及时前往正规医疗机构就诊。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="requirements-card">
    <view class="section-title">开始前请确认</view>
    <view
      class="requirement-item"
      wx:for="{{requirements}}"
      wx:key="title"
    >
      <view class="requirement-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</view>
      <view class="requirement-content">
        <view class="requirement-title">{{item.title}}</view>
        <view class="requirement-description">{{item.description}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="duration-row">
    <view class="duration-icon" aria-hidden="true">⏱</view>
    <view class="duration-copy">
      <view class="duration-title">大约需要 3 分钟</view>
      <view class="duration-description">测试将依次完成左耳和右耳的 6 个频率</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="guide-actions">
    <button class="start-button" hover-class="start-button--pressed">开始测试</button>
    <button class="skip-button" hover-class="skip-button--pressed">跳过本次</button>
  </view>
</view>
